%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant SW as Software
    participant CORE as AOU_CORE
    participant BRG as AOU_FDI_BRINGUP_CTRL
    participant ADP as UCIe Adapter
    participant REM as Remote die
    Note over CORE,ADP: Link Active, AoU ENABLED
    SW->>CORE: APB write AOU_INIT.DEACTIVATE_START = 1
    Note over CORE: DEACTIVATE - drains, then
    CORE->>REM: DeactivateReq
    REM->>CORE: DeactivateAck
    Note over CORE: DISABLED, DEACTIVATE_START self-clears
    Note over CORE,ADP: unchanged - ACTIVE, lp_state_req = Active, O_FDI_LINK_UP = 1, O_INT_FSM_IN_ACTIVE = 1
    Note over ADP: pl_state_sts stays Active (0001)
    Note over SW: nothing on the UCIe controller
